{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>StarNomads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship. Gather resources. Build weapons. Upgrade. Colonize planets. Protect your mothership. Destroy your enemies. In this Real-Time Strategy, Turn-Based, Roguelike game, you command a spaceship seeking to colonize various planets with hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, gather resources, build weapons and equipment, and make various upgrades that can take you further and further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/extras/48ed4063fe4483d898f7841d0725fa25.avif?t=1771958007\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/extras_big/48ed4063fe4483d898f7841d0725fa25.avif?t=1771958007 width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op with up to four players, or in arena mode with up to eight players in frantic battles for planet colonization and resource domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets feature varied environments with unique obstacles. A new challenge every round. Build your strategy based on the obstacles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship and weapon upgrades are limitless. Create strategies based on long-range damage, close-range combat, movement speed, or a mix of everything.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171060?t=1771958007","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771958007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/fb7e28ae27de625a306f8c92aba0bdce55928f4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771958007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/fb7e28ae27de625a306f8c92aba0bdce55928f4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771958007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3302640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>StarNomads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship. Gather resources. Build weapons. Upgrade. Colonize planets. Protect your mothership. Destroy your enemies. In this Real-Time Strategy, Turn-Based, Roguelike game, you command a spaceship seeking to colonize various planets with hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, gather resources, build weapons and equipment, and make various upgrades that can take you further and further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/extras/48ed4063fe4483d898f7841d0725fa25.avif?t=1771958007\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/extras_big/48ed4063fe4483d898f7841d0725fa25.avif?t=1771958007 width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op with up to four players, or in arena mode with up t